{% assign faq_cat_1 = 'General information about ëkcos' %}
{% assign faq_q_1_1 = 'Who is ëkcos?' %}
{% assign faq_a_1_1 = 'ëkcos is an American brand with a factory in Mexico specializing in sustainable fragranced hygiene products for public restrooms. Their portfolio includes urinal screens, toilet bowl clips, and other passive air fresheners – all developed with a focus on performance, fragrance intensity and longevity, and splash control (urinal screens).' %}
{% assign faq_q_1_2 = 'What makes ëkcos different from standard products?' %}
{% assign faq_a_1_2 = 'ëkcos products last significantly longer (60+ days), release a consistently strong fragrance, and include advanced antisplash features. Despite being 60+ days lasting, they don’t cost twice as much as other high-quality 30-day alternatives – yet deliver much more in hygiene, sustainability, cost savings, and user satisfaction.' %}

{% assign faq_cat_2 = 'Urinal screens: ëkcoscreen & xcrën HD' %}
