{% assign faq_a_2_1_item_2 = 'powër screen and üro lite: up to 30 days' %}
{% assign faq_q_2_2 = 'What is antisplash technology and how does it work?' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_2 = 'ëkcos screens feature a bristle system that effectively breaks the urine stream and prevents splash back. This keeps the surrounding floor cleaner and reduces bacterial contamination.' %}
{% assign faq_q_2_3 = 'Is there scientific evidence for antisplash benefits?' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_3 = 'Yes. A 2021 study in Antimicrobial Resistance & Infection Control (BioMed Central) shows that bacteria such as Klebsiella pneumoniae can be spread by urine splashes in public toilets. ëkcos antisplash technology significantly reduces this risk of spreading from urinals.' %}
{% assign faq_q_2_4 = 'What are the main environmental benefits of ëkcos products?' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_4_item_1 = 'All ëkcos products are 99% biodegradable in bioactive landfills within 5 years.' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_4_item_2 = 'Made from recycled materials.' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_4_item_3 = 'Packaged in eco-friendly cellophane bags.' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_4_item_4 = 'Environmentally friendly fragrance composition (non-toxic to the environment, especially wastewater), VOC-compliant.' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_4_item_5 = 'ëkcoscreen and xcrën HD last 60+ days compared to the typical 30 days on the market = extended time before replacement is needed.' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_4_item_6 = 'Passive interior fragrance complete solution = urinal screen + frësh drop and ëkco clip; no aerosols or concentrated and heated aromatic oils (some of which may be carcinogenic).' %}
{% assign faq_q_2_5 = 'How is the fragrance released?' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_5 = 'The fragrance is infused directly into the polymer and is released passively over time. No dripping or refill is required. ëkcos products are known for their strong, long-lasting fragrance from day 1 to day 60 and even more.' %}
{% assign faq_q_2_6 = 'Do customers return to cheaper screens after trying ëkcos?' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_6 = 'Rarely. Once customers experience the hygiene, performance, and consistent fragrance of ëkcos screens, they tend to stick with the brand. Satisfaction levels are exceptionally high.' %}
{% assign faq_q_2_7 = 'How do ëkcos prices compare to others?' %}
{% assign faq_a_2_7 = 'ëkcos 60+ day screens are competitively priced – they cost less than two high-quality 30-day screens, yet deliver more value in fragrance strength, the most advanced antisplash system, eco-friendly features (recycled materials, biodegradability), and cost efficiency.' %}

