{% assign faq_q_3_1 = 'What fragrances are available?' %}
{% assign faq_a_3_1 = 'Popular fragrance options include citrus, mango, apple, melon, and more. All fragrances are designed to be noticeable yet pleasant, ideal for restrooms, lobbies, locker rooms, or commercial spaces.' %}
